OL,3,GNEWSATravelling telephone box tells
OL,4,Atown's stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FA red telephone box which plays audio
OL,7,Fmonologues of stories from people in
OL,8,FBarnsley through a handset is setting
OL,9,Foff on a tour of the town.
OL,11,FThe "Calling Barnsley" project was
OL,12,Fcreated by Lung Theatre group who
OL,13,Frecorded the monologues and built a
OL,14,Flife-sized phone box, which has been
OL,15,Fhoused in the Barnsley Civic Arts
OL,16,FCentre since January.
OL,18,FNow, the group is hoping to "share the
OL,19,Fstories" to as the box embarks on a
OL,20,Fsix-month tour of the town's libraries.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
