OL,3,GNEWSATravelling telephone box tells
OL,4,Atown's stories
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatt Woodhead, theatre co-director,
OL,7,Fsaid, "There's a poeticism in the way
OL,8,Fthat people in Barnsley speak. You
OL,9,Fcan't knock about town without someone
OL,10,Fpulling your ear and telling you the
OL,11,Fmost incredible story."
